Short:        68000 Source code statistics generator. V1.0
Author:       Laurence Vanhelsuwé
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection
Tested:       V40 A3000 with 2Mb CHIP, 5Mb FAST.
Date:         1992.02.22

Filter/Statistics program which analyzes standard 68000	assembly source code and
produces mnemonics statistics while also filtering out all unrecognized lines.
Output files can be fed directly to a small barchart display program "chart" (inc).
Test source for "chart" included.

